{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45541","headline":"辞郡守李公恩命 · 恒超","name":"辞郡守李公恩命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚着褐衣老，浮杯道不成。\n誓传经论死，不染利名生。\n厌树遮山色，怜窗向月明。\n他时随范蠡，一棹五湖清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"恒超","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}